          "filename": "North East coast of Scalpay - geograph.org.uk - 146120.jpg",
          "caption": "North East coast of Scalpay. Taken at a spring low tide, exposing much sea-weed, this shot shows the Shiants on the horizon to the right and North Harris to the left. The landscape is much more rounded and green on this side of the island. You'll just see a peat bank in the middle.",
